amai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600720/extras/e99d6629e99b1c38f5ae4db8fdf876b5.poster.avif?t=1754978125\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600720/extras/e99d6629e99b1c38f5ae4db8fdf876b5.webm?t=1754978125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600720/extras/e99d6629e99b1c38f5ae4db8fdf876b5.mp4?t=1754978125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diplomacy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do your people grow weary of war? Sue for peace with an adversary. Running low on resources? Offer to sell some scientific knowledge. Once you discover alien civilizations and learn how to communicate with them, trade and negotiation create new opportunities for growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600720/extras/0c4ce546dd8ea7072a99fe510dc34d9c.poster.avif?t=1754978125\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600720/extras/0c4ce546dd8ea7072a99fe510dc34d9c.webm?t=1754978125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600720/extras/0c4ce546dd8ea7072a99fe510dc34d9c.mp4?t=1754978125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Research</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide what technology to research to fit your play-style. Will you focus on diplomatic tools like Xenolinguistics and Empathic resonance? Research tech for building your economy, like Colony domes and Socio-techanization? Or develop weapons of war, like Battlecruisers and Heavy blasters?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
